# mm.usb test target

Exercises the shared USB vocabulary (endpoint address bit decoding, setup packet
decoding), unserved fallback behaviour for device and host, and recording stand-ins
verifying device and host state machines, one reply/stall contract, and nonblocking /
bounded transfers.
